      20260922 (ucrt, clang 23.1.2) and SCons: platform=windows arch=x86_64
      target=template_release precision=double use_mingw=yes use_llvm=yes, no
      JIT and no TCC. sha256:
      libgodot_riscv.windows.template_release.double.x86_64.dll
      939b694cf5bec117b8de15a008d81d8e149b14105ccb2121531d5aa28abb7ff2. The
      translations in bintr/ are made against this build (its Machine layout
      enters each hash) by tools/build.exs and are not tracked.
